title: Host and guest type bursts at the end of the same line at the same time and end with the same text
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: (?s)line 04\nline 05[Ab0-9.]{160}\nline 06
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: A01\..*A02\..*A03\..*A04\..*A05\..*A06\..*A07\..*A08\..*A09\..*A10\..*A11\..*A12\..*A13\..*A14\..*A15\..*A16\..*A17\..*A18\..*A19\..*A20\.
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: b01\..*b02\..*b03\..*b04\..*b05\..*b06\..*b07\..*b08\..*b09\..*b10\..*b11\..*b12\..*b13\..*b14\..*b15\..*b16\..*b17\..*b18\..*b19\..*b20\.

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9000
edit notes.txt 5 1
key end
wait 1500
type A01.
wait 150
